# Frontend & Node
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/

# Frontend bundle deployed into the backend static dir. It is intentionally
# TRACKED so a fresh clone runs without a Node toolchain; regenerate it with
# `cd frontend && npm run deploy` after changing frontend/src (the Docker build
# always rebuilds it from source). galgame2voice/static/characters/ and static/js/
# are hand-maintained assets.

